Third-Party Notices: Bundled BUFR Tables
=======================================

This directory contains the following data files that are derived from
third-party material:

  table_b.json
  table_d.json

Source
------

Both files represent the WMO BUFR edition 4 master tables as published in the
"wmo-im/BUFR4" repository:

  Repository: https://github.com/wmo-im/BUFR4
  Version:    tag v44
  Commit:     6a6cf0d0ecbfc7ed3cd4a7cc581979db937607cd (2025-05-06)

  table_b.json  <-  BUFRCREX_TableB_en_*.csv  (BUFR Table B, class 00-42)
  table_d.json  <-  BUFR_TableD_en_*.csv      (BUFR Table D, category 00-40)

The tables are published by the World Meteorological Organization (WMO) in the
Manual on Codes, Volume I.2 (WMO-No. 306), Part B, Binary Codes.

